    <!-- REVIEW: heikler Text, Freigabe Projektinhaber -->
    <string name="profile_info">The body profile avatar follows the optional gender selection: man, woman or a small Jedi for diverse / other. Without a choice the neutral figure stays. No user account and no cloud. The details are not yet linked to medical or calorie estimation formulas. The age for each day is calculated from the date of birth; it stays stored locally.</string>
