    <!-- REVIEW: heikler Text, Freigabe Projektinhaber -->
    <string name="recording_info">When enabled, PulsLibre starts the recording service automatically when the app is opened and connects to the CIRQA band. This only happens if Bluetooth is already on and the permissions have already been granted; PulsLibre never turns Bluetooth on by itself. Default: off. Recordings that are already running are not started twice. You can still stop them in the app or from the notification.</string>
