    <string name="main_hist_info">Files are stored locally and privately. FIT measurements are also imported into SQLite; unknown file types are kept as originals.</string>
    <string name="main_hist_button">Download history</string>
    <string name="main_hist_confirm_title">Download CIRQA history?</string>
    <!-- REVIEW: heikler Text, Freigabe Projektinhaber -->
    <string name="main_hist_confirm_message">PulsLibre now connects to the paired CIRQA and requests the available file list including continuations and file pulls. The sync request may cause the device to mark data as transferred. PulsLibre sends no delete, archive, SetFlags or reset commands. Files are stored privately within the displayed safety limits; FIT files are imported after a CRC check. A run can end incomplete because of safety limits or a lost connection; the status then shows this. The device’s complete history is only proven after confirmed list pagination.</string>
